8
00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.835
Stop.

9
00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:32.030
P.

10
00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.355
Hea mees.

11
00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:45.990
Pikali pikali, oi siin ikka veel.
Nii hõimupäev.

12
00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.390
Tervist

13
00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:53.660
sina, mina olen, mina olen piip
ja see on mina olen tuu ja mina.

14
00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:58.940
Mina olen
nii ongi Meie oleme ju just st.

15
